// BusinessPulse Power Query parameters
//
// This file is intentionally NOT an executable query. Create both parameters
// in Power BI Desktop: Home -> Manage Parameters -> New Parameter.
//
//   MySqlServer   Text   "127.0.0.1:3306"   (host:port; this build used :3307)
//   MySqlDatabase Text   "businesspulse"
//
// Do not paste credentials into this file. Power BI stores them separately.
//
// The queries in this folder reference MySqlServer and MySqlDatabase directly.
// If your MySQL provider requires a certificate option or a different
// navigation shape, record the deviation in powerbi/README.md.
